{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Or it gore a son.</b> A son who is a minor." "<b>Or a daughter.</b> Who is a minor girl. Since it says ״and it kill a man or a woman,״ one might think he is liable only for adults — therefore Scripture says ״or it gore a son״ etc., to make him liable for minors as for adults (ibid.)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:42.118264496Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}